Rename audio files according to their tags using path templates.

Usage: tfmt [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  clear-history    Clear the rename history
  resolve-history  Resolve the last attempted action in history after manual file repair
  show-history     Show a summary of the rename history
  list-templates   Show a summary of template in the current and application directory
  rename           Use a template to rename audio files according to their tags
  validate         Validate audio files and their tags
  undo             Undo actions
  redo             Redo actions
  help             Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --config-directory <CUSTOM_CONFIG_DIRECTORY>
          Sets a custom configuration directory. Defaults to '~/.tfmt'
  -d, --dry-run
          Don't actually perform actions
      --simple
          Don't display progress bars
  -n, --no-confirm
          Skips confirmation prompt. Suitable for non-interactive use
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
